2. I want to say steel, but I realize now that 26&#160;km of steel cable is going to be very heavy. I'm either going to have to change the distances or rethink the recovery method.<br />
3. It's a separate reality pocket that exists outside the euclidean geometry of the real world. I'm going to need to make it have an entrance and defined parameters.<br />
