<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre: Sci-Fi</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: A cave Approximately 1.2 yards wide when looked outside.<br />
- It seems to have a more stronger gravitational pull Than earth<br />
- The cause of it's gravitational pull isn't yet discovered.<br />
- It seems to get wider and deeper as you travel more, making it hard for someone to go back.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: An anomalous cave that has a different Gravitational Pull than earth. It has a more stronger pull inside the cave. The cave's gravitational pull gets stronger as it gets deeper.</p>
